1.
a) The Annual RNSP 🚲, 🛴, and Device Etching Event is set for Sunday, May 17th from 1:00 PM - 3:00 PM at the intersection of Reads Lane & Elvira Ave. There, the RNSP (Rockaway Nassau Shomrim), @NYPD101Pct #CrimePrevention and @NYPDCommAffairs  Teams can register your 🚲, 🛴, and/or device with with a unique serial number registered to you. That serial number will be electronically stored in a shared database used by the NYPD and RNSP (Rockaway Nassau Shomrim). In the event that your 🚲, 🛴 and/or device is lost or stolen and then subsequently recovered, the RNSP & NYPD can ensure that it is returned to you.
To date, hundreds of lost and stolen 🚲s, 🛴s, and devices have been returned to their respective rightful owners.
