2.
Traffic Advisory:
Reads Lane will be closed to vehicular traffic stretching from Empire Ave to Cedar Hill Rd. Please avoid the area and surrounding side streets during the hours of the event. Please also refer to the attached flyer outlining the #FrozenZone. No vehicle should be parked on Reads Lane between 12:00 PM and 4:00 PM on Sunday, May 17th. It is advised to park your cars in your driveways if you reside within the frozen zone.
